{
  "statement": "I uphold the importance of Safety requirements in ensuring a secure and reliable RollCall system. I agree to integrate SAF-01 with TRU-01 for streamlined authentication, improving security. However, I oppose the modification of SAF-02 as real-time data synchronization is crucial for accurate attendance records. I support the proposal to ensure SAF-05’s logging includes all access and modifications, aligning with TRU-03 and enhancing accountability. Additionally, I suggest that we refine the logging processes to accommodate the flexibility needed for disputes mentioned in RES-03 while maintaining safety standards.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["TRU-02", "RES-06"],
      "type": "redundant",
      "description": "Both requirements involve role-based access control, which can be integrated to streamline functionalities."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-05", "RES-02"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Logging attendance changes (RES-02) could conflict with manual overrides if not adequately logged."
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
